                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>&lt;i&gt;(part of a letter from Alyia to her sister Lucille, translated from Enbesan)...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Father's not the same since mother died— he's too old to work like he does— but he agrees with the Elder Moot that I'm only a young girl and would serve him best by staying at home and out of mischief. &lt;br/&gt;But &lt;b&gt;I have defied all of them — I have been dressing as a boy&lt;/b&gt; and working, so that father will be able to pay the tithe this year. &lt;br/&gt;I would be now, if I had not gotten hurt today...such a small mark, but my face feels puffy...</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>43741</LineID>
                </Text>
